="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;b&gt;Notation&lt;/b&gt; (UML state machine)&lt;br&gt;Rounded box = state (lower part lists internal activities) &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; ● initial state &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; ◉ final state &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; ◇ choice pseudostate&lt;br&gt;Transition label: &lt;i&gt;event [guard] / action&lt;/i&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; when(...) = change event &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; after(...) = time event &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; entry / ... = entry action" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1080" width="1100" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>